sequenceDiagram
  actor Manager
  actor Admin
  actor Resident
  participant UsersController
  participant UserService

  Manager->>UsersController: GET /api/platform/users
  UsersController->>UserService: GetAllUsersAsync()
  UserService-->>UsersController: all users
  UsersController-->>Manager: 200 OK

  Admin->>UsersController: GET /api/platform/users/condominium/{condoId}
  Note over UsersController: Admin is limited to own condominium.
  UsersController->>UserService: GetUsersByCondominiumAsync(condoId)
  UserService-->>UsersController: condominium users
  UsersController-->>Admin: 200 OK or 403

  Manager->>UsersController: POST /api/platform/users
  UsersController->>UserService: CreateUserAsync(request)
  UserService-->>UsersController: created user
  UsersController-->>Manager: 201 Created

  Admin->>UsersController: POST /api/platform/users
  Note over UsersController: Admin cannot create Manager users and must use own condominium.
  UsersController-->>Admin: 201 Created or 403

  Resident->>UsersController: GET /api/platform/users/{id}
  Note over UsersController: Resident can only access own profile.
  UsersController-->>Resident: 200 OK or 403
